WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:21.064
(slow magical music)

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.280
- [Narrator] Welcome to North Ronaldsay,

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.343
a small remote island off the
northern reaches of Scotland.

00:00:28.343 --> 00:00:30.139
Home to around 50 people,

00:00:30.139 --> 00:00:33.983
two lighthouses, an airport,

00:00:33.983 --> 00:00:36.840
some sheep, cattle,

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.662
and a few seals; and that's about it.

00:00:39.662 --> 00:00:41.660
Not much of a labor force.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.810
So while on the mainland
you might have one,

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.110
maybe two jobs,

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:48.908
up here it's more like six or seven.

00:00:48.908 --> 00:00:50.983
Meet Sarah Moore.

